  "notes": "M7.B + M7.C IPC Cleanup Defense-in-Depth implemented.\n\nM7.B (cleanOrphanIpcDirs): Added async function to src/core/orphan-cleaner.ts using fs/promises. Scans .deckent/ for sprint-NNN-ipc directories, removes all except currentJobId. Returns count of cleaned dirs. Handles missing .deckent/ gracefully (returns 0).\n\nM7.C (sprint-runner-entry self-cleanup): Added rmSync to imports and registered process.on('exit') handler at top-level scope (before main()). Handler only deletes IPC dir on exitCode 0 or undefined (success). Non-zero exit codes preserve IPC dir for post-mortem debugging.\n\nTests: 7 new tests in tests/core/orphan-cleaner-ipc.test.ts — all pass. M7.C tests use a temporary .cjs file instead of --eval because process.argv[2] is not correctly propagated in --eval mode.\n\nPre-existing tsc errors in config-validator.ts, timeout-estimator.ts, and mid-sprint-adapter.ts — none caused by our changes.",
